      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikusinjila khulukuku lweinyanza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tsisolo tsibili",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana ndalola isolo niyitikulukha niyirula munyanza, niyili nende tsinzika ekhumi nemirwe musaafu; ne khunzika tsiayo bialikhwo ebimwata ekhumi biobwami; khandi khumirwe chiayo, ameera kamanyeko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nayo isolo eya ndalola yafwana shinga ingwe; habula ebilenje biayo bieengana ebieitubu, omunwa nakwo nikwingana okweitalanyi; okuyokha nikuchiheelesia obunyali bwakwo, neshifumbi shiakwo shiobwami, noburuchi obunji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindola omurwe kwayo mulala nikufwana shinga okwaarwa olukuma okhuula khukhufwa; habula olukuma Iwokhufwa lwali nilwahona; ne eshialo shiosi shiali nishing'ang'aalila isolo tsana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibakwinamila okuyokha, shichila kwali nikuheelesiye isolo oburuchi bwakwo; nibachiinamila isolo, nibasunga bari Ali heena owingana isolo eyo? Kata ali heena owakhanyala okhuchiseera?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana isolo yaheebwa obwiyangu okhuboola nomunwa kwayo amakhuwa amakhulumamu nende amanyeko; niyiheebwa oburuchi bwemiesi amakhumi kane nachibili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niyichinga omunwa niyisindobola amanyeko khuNyasaye, niyinyeka eliiralie, neshimenyoshie, kata nende abo abamenyanga mwikulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi yafuchiililwa okhuseera abatakatifu bosi nokhubahula; niyiheebwa oburuchi khubuli luyia nabuli bandu nabuli lulimi nabuli lihanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo bosi abamenya mushialo balachiinamila, buli mundu owa eliiralie lirahandiikwa mushitabu shiobulamu shieLikondi elieerwa okhurula khumusuule ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu yesi ouli namarwi, ahulile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu yesi oukhoyeele obubohwi, atsie mububohwi. Omundu yesi owira nolukanga, khatimba yeerwe nolukanga. Hano niho aha obwifwili nobusuubili bwabatakatifu bwenyelungwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana ndalola isolo yindi khandi niyitikulukha niyirula mwiloba; nayo yali netsinzika tsibili shingana likondi; ne okhuboola yaboola shinga okuyokha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nayo niyiikhoonyela oburuchi bwosi bweisolo yambeli eyo, niyili imbeli wayo. Niyihachilisia eshialo nende abamenyangamwo okhwinamila isolo yambeli eyo, eya olukuma lwayo Iwokhufwa lwali nilwahona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niyikhola ebilolelo ebikhongo, kata okhuula khukhwisia omulilo khushialo okhurula mwikulu, imbeli wabandu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niyibakaatia abamenya mushialo khulwa ebilolelo ebia yafuchiililwa okhukhola imbeli weisolo; niyiboolela abamenyanga mushialo okhuchikasilia isolo eyo eshifwanani, eyo eyaremwa nolukanga, nebutswa yishilinji mwoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi niyifuchiililwa okhushiheelesia omuuya eshifwanani shieisolo eshio, mbu eshifwanani shieisolo shiboole, khandi mbu shichile abo abareenamila eshifwanani shieisolo ta, beerwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi niyihachilisia bosi, abatuutu nabakhongo, abayinda nabamanani, abeebule nabasumba, mbu baheebwe eshimanyilo mushikalo shiomukhono musaatsa kata khubweni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khandi mbu omundu yesi arafuchiililwa okhukulanga kata okhukusinjia ebindu ta, habula ouli neshimanyilo tsana, niIwo eliira lieisolo kata isabu yeliira liayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hano niho aha obuchesi bwenyelungwa. Ouli omuchesi abasie isabu yeisolo; isabu yene yisinjilila eliira liomundu, khandi tsisabu tsietsinyukuta tsihela ebikhumi bisasaba amakhumi kasasaba natsisasaba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
